---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Amierul Faiz" description="My journey, education background, and what I’m focusing on." >
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-10 max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-cyan-400">About</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-5xl">My Journey & Education</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
        A quick story of where I started, what I’m learning now, and how my education supports my goal in cybersecurity.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="relative">
      <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute left-4 top-2 bottom-2 w-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/20"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-cyan-400/0 via-cyan-400/60 to-cyan-400/0 blur-[1px]"
        ></div>
        <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-1 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-cyan-300/40 blur-sm" />
        <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-1 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-cyan-200/20 animate-pulse" />
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <article class="group relative rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/70 p-7 pl-14 shadow-lg shadow-black/20 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-cyan-400/50 hover:shadow-cyan-500/10 hover:shadow-2xl">
          <div class="absolute left-1 top-7 flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-cyan-300/30 bg-zinc-950/60">
            <div class="relative h-8 w-8">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-cyan-400/15 blur" />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-300">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" class="h-5 w-5">
                  <path d="M12 2l7 4v6c0 5-3 9-7 10-4-1-7-5-7-10V6l7-4z" />
                  <path d="M9.5 12l1.8 1.8L15 10" />
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <h3 class="font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-white">
                High School
              </h3>
              <span
                class="font-mono text-sm text-cyan-300"
                data-typed="2015 to 2019"
              >
                <span class="typed-caret" />
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-200">Location:</span> Sekolah Menengah Sains Hulu Terengganu
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
              Built a strong foundation in science and technical subjects, setting the path for my engineering and technology journey.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="group relative rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/70 p-7 pl-14 shadow-lg shadow-black/20 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-cyan-400/50 hover:shadow-cyan-500/10 hover:shadow-2xl">
          <div class="absolute left-1 top-7 flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-cyan-300/30 bg-zinc-950/60">
            <div class="relative h-8 w-8">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-cyan-400/15 blur" />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-300">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" class="h-5 w-5">
                  <rect x="7" y="7" width="10" height="10" rx="2" />
                  <path d="M4 9h3M4 15h3M17 9h3M17 15h3" />
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <h3 class="font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-white">
                Diploma Level
              </h3>
              <span
                class="font-mono text-sm text-cyan-300"
                data-typed="Aug 2020 to Apr 2023"
              >
                <span class="typed-caret" />
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-200">Location:</span> Universiti Malaysia Perlis (UniMAP)
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-200">Title:</span> Diploma in Computer Engineering
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-200">Awards:</span> Program Ijazah Dalam Negara (PIDN), JPA Scholar
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
              Learned the core fundamentals of computer systems, hardware diagnostics, and early networking concepts.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="group relative rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/70 p-7 pl-14 shadow-lg shadow-black/20 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-cyan-400/50 hover:shadow-cyan-500/10 hover:shadow-2xl">
          <div class="absolute left-1 top-7 flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-cyan-300/30 bg-zinc-950/60">
            <div class="relative h-8 w-8">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-cyan-400/15 blur" />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-300">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" class="h-5 w-5">
                  <path d="M12 21s-7-4.35-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 6.65-7 11-7 11z" />
                  <path d="M9.5 10.5h5" />
                  <path d="M12 8v5" />
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <h3 class="font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-white">
                Bachelor Degree
              </h3>
              <span
                class="font-mono text-sm text-cyan-300"
                data-typed="Sep 2023 to Nov 2027"
              >
                <span class="typed-caret" />
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-200">Location:</span> Universiti Malaysia Perlis (UniMAP)
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-200">Title:</span> Bachelor of Electronic Engineering Technology (Electronic Network Design) with honours
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-200">Details:</span> Current CGPA 3.72
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
              Deepening my skills in electronic network design, focusing heavily on SOC environments, penetration testing, and securing critical systems.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

    <style is:global>
      .typed-caret {
        display: inline-block;
        width: 0.6ch;
        margin-left: 2px;
        height: 1.2em;
        transform: translateY(0.15em);
        border-right: 2px solid #22d3ee;
        animation: caretBlink 1s step-end infinite;
      }

      @keyframes caretBlink {
        0%, 50% { opacity: 1; }
        50.01%, 100% { opacity: 0; }
      }

      .group:hover [data-typed] {
        color: #67e8f9;
      }
    </style>

    <script>
      const typedTargets = document.querySelectorAll('[data-typed]');
      typedTargets.forEach((el) => {
        if (!(el instanceof HTMLElement)) return;
        const text = el.getAttribute('data-typed') || '';
        // render empty initially
        el.textContent = '';
        const caret = document.createElement('span');
        caret.className = 'typed-caret';
        el.appendChild(caret);

        el.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {
          if (el.dataset.done === 'true') return;
          el.dataset.done = 'true';
          const caretEl = el.querySelector('.typed-caret');
          if (caretEl) el.removeChild(caretEl);


          let i = 0;
          const speed = 18;
          const run = () => {
            i++;
            el.insertAdjacentText('beforeend', text.charAt(i - 1));
            if (i < text.length) {
              setTimeout(run, speed);
            } else {
              el.appendChild(caret);
            }
          };
          setTimeout(run, speed);
        }, { once: true });
      });
    </script>

  </section>
</Layout>

